OL,3,GNEWSAMore plans for Northumberland Line
OL,4,Aextension
OL,5,
OL,6,FA council leader has said he hopes to
OL,7,Fsee plans for an upgrade to the
OL,8,FNorthumberland Line submitted by next
OL,9,Fautumn.
OL,11,FThe railway line has been hugely
OL,12,Fpopular since it opened in 2024,
OL,13,Fprompting extension proposals to
OL,14,FWoodhorn and Newbiggin, which were
OL,15,Fbacked by Northumberland County
OL,16,FCouncil, the North East Mayor and rail
OL,17,Foperator Northern.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,397,390,260,160,0,100
