OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$ -,* %-.*,$%** %-& (,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAMore plans for Northumberland Line
OL,4,Aextension
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt this stage, officials have only set
OL,7,Fa target for the extension to be
OL,8,Ffinished by 2040, along with a raft of
OL,9,Fupgrades planned for the region's rail
OL,10,Fnetworks.
OL,12,FHowever council leader Glen Sanderson
OL,13,Fsaid mayoral funding would allow for
OL,14,Fthe "next step of extending the line"
OL,15,Fadding he hoped the first planning
OL,16,Fapplication would be in by autumn 2027.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
